<title>FINLAND: Kesko Jan-Aug sales excl VAT up 25 pct.</title>
<headline>Kesko Jan-Aug sales excl VAT up 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish retailer and wholesaler Kesko Oy said in a statement on Friday its January-August sales excluding value-added-tax rose 25.0 percent year-on-year to 22.6 billion markka.  </p>
<p>It said Tuko's sales are included in Kesko's figures from June 1, 1996, and Kaukomarkkinat's sales are included from May 1, 1996.</p>
<p>In August, Kesko's sales excluding VAT rose 56.2 percent year-on-year to 3.7 billion markka, it said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
